DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42457::$$$message_0336_0000_0000$$$::"Got a sec, Archer?[lr]::
42458::$$$message_0336_0000_0001$$$::I'm about to head out."::
42459::$$$message_0336_0000_0002$$$::"I can spare a moment. What's the letter for?"::
42460::$$$message_0336_0000_0003$$$::"Hehehe. The reason I'm going. [l][hffacechg chara=凛 face=喜 layer=0 time=200][hfpop layer=0][say storage=HRIN1_RIN_0040 _name=凛]My efforts are finally bearing fruit."::
42461::$$$message_0336_0000_0004$$$::"...An onsen that raises Luck?[lr]::
42462::$$$message_0336_0000_0005$$$::Even if it does exist, will it really work?"::
42463::$$$message_0336_0000_0006$$$::"Totally. It's guaranteed by the Mage's Association."::
42464::$$$message_0336_0000_0007$$$::"The report does come from the Association... But what's the hurry?"::
42465::$$$message_0336_0000_0008$$$::"There's a recharge time. Once it raises the stat enough, it just turns back into a normal bath again until it's recharged."::
42466::$$$message_0336_0000_0009$$$::"...Hm. Well, I won't stop you."::
42467::$$$message_0336_0000_0010$$$::"I don't like the way you said that..."::
42468::$$$message_0336_0000_0011$$$::"Don't mind me. Shouldn't you hurry, then? Someone else might use it if you're late."::
42469::$$$message_0336_0000_0012$$$::"This town is full of ears."::
42470::$$$message_0336_0000_0013$$$::"Yeah. [l][hffacechg chara=凛 face=喜 layer=0 time=200][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HRIN1_RIN_0100 _name=凛]Let's hurry, Archer. You can handle security."::

